# Working trees are LF everywhere, including on Windows.
#
# This machine has `core.autocrlf=true`, which rewrites every file git touches
# to CRLF on checkout. Prettier's `endOfLine` default is `lf`, so that checkout
# artefact fails the format gate on the whole changed set — and it is why git
# kept warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF" on every file this project edits.
# Fixed here rather than by relaxing the gate.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
